Zi in Eq (2) represents the core explanatory variable mentioned in (1), Qθ(EmployiZi) represents the conditional quantile of Employi, θ represents the examined quantile, φθ is the vector of coefficients corresponding to θ, the estimation method is the minimization of the absolute deviation. The computation method of φθ in Eq (2) is shown as in Eq (3):




φθ=argmin{∑iEmployi≥Xiφθ/Suratioi−Xiφ/+∑i,Suratioi<Xiφ(1−θ)/Suratioi−Xiφ/}


